guarantee: T-007 Q7 / review 1 #3: a retry writes its own dictation line under the original rec=, without press_to_frame_ms, duration_ms, end or detector (a JobFinished without an open record writes no line: the retry line dropped)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/diag/observer.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
            } => {
                let record = self.record(recording);
                record.local = local;
--- new
            } => {
                if !self.records.contains_key(&recording) {
                    return None;
                }
                let record = self.record(recording);
                record.local = local;
--- end
